#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:9
msgid ""
"This Masterclass explains how mechanical forces can be modeled using PLUMED,"
" and the application of the FISST module for applying multiple forces "
"simultaneously."
msgstr ""

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:11
msgid "Objectives"
msgstr "到達目標"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:13
msgid "The objectives of this Masterclass are:"
msgstr "この Masterclass の到達目標は次のとおりである。"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:14
msgid "Learn how to apply a constant force in PLUMED"
msgstr ""

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:15
msgid ""
"Learn how to perform steered-MD in PLUMED, and approximately get a free "
"energy surface from repeating this calculation"
msgstr ""

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:16
msgid ""
"Learn how to apply constant forces with FISST, and reweight to different "
"intermediate forces"
msgstr ""

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:18
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:20
msgid ""
"We assume that the person that will follow this tutorial is familiar with "
"the Linux terminal, Gromacs and basic functionality of PLUMED."
msgstr ""

